| Start a new model run | `STATE.md` | current prompt registry |

## Report and computation rule

`reports/` is intentionally provenance-rich. Unlisted reports are noncanonical by default. A correction/regression may override stronger older wording.

Computation is appropriate for exact certificates, finite enumeration, regressions, and candidate discovery. A script does not establish global minimum-diameter optimality without a theorem that supplies the bridge.